WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the Kindred Spirit showcase (demo/out/kindred-spirit-showcase-720p.mp4), transcribed locally with
whisper.cpp and corrected by hand. "You" is the player; Pip's lines are her live answers in the recording.

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.280
<v You>Hi Pip, what can you see around us?

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:12.640
<v Pip>Morning! There are some woolly sheep over there, and a lot of water.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.640
<v You>Where are the sheep? Lead the way.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.600
<v Pip>Right ahead of us! Follow the sparkles.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
<v You>Pip, can you mine this iron for me?

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:45.240
<v Pip>On it! Found a bit of iron for you.

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:55.500
<v You>Now chop this tree and bring me the logs.

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:02.080
<v Pip>Wood coming right up! I'll grab every last bit.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:06.820
<v You>What am I missing to make a piston?

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:14.120
<v Pip>You need some cobblestone and a bit of redstone dust.

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:24.540
<v You>Pip, build us a cozy cottage right here, for two.

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:32.140
<v Pip>A cottage! It's rising right now. Look at those birch walls!

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.580
<v You>This is our cottage. Remember it.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:44.260
<v Pip>Got it. Our cottage. It smells like fresh birch!

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:47.720
<v You>Can you give me night vision?

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:55.280
<v Pip>There! Now you can see in the dark like I do.

00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:59.760
<v You>And enchant my sword with sharpness, please.

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:06.360
<v Pip>Done! It's extra pointy now. Careful with that.

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:10.220
<v Pip>Creeper! Watch out behind you!

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.400
<v You>Help, protect me!

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:23.800
<v Pip>Shoo! I've pushed them back for you. Stay safe!

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:29.840
<v You>Take me back to our cottage.

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:35.100
<v Pip>Follow me! It's just ahead.

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:46.620
<v Pip>Here we are!

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:54.980
<v Pip>Eep! That was my elbow-ish bit!

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:58.980
<v You>Oops, sorry Pip! That was an accident.

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:06.180
<v Pip>It's okay. I'm mostly made of air and secrets anyway.

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:09.560
<v Pip>Hee hee, that tickles!

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:14.640
<v You>It's so dark out here. Can you light the way?

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:20.600
<v Pip>There! I'll be your little floating lantern.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:50.500
[gentle music while Pip tries on her skins]
